    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>On a failed Will save, the target becomes incorporeal, invisible, and intangible for the duration. It cannot interact with the material world. You can still see the target, but cannot affect it with further spells unless you also become incorporeal. Use the normal incorporeal rules for movement and interaction.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Apply and remove the complete incorporeal and invisible state manually.</p>"
    },
